        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/4/n/cobh-wp/cobh-pronounced-cove-dominates-1.jpg",
          "filename": "Cobh (pronounced Cove) dominates Cork Harbour one of the largest natural harbours in the world (7174119723).jpg",
          "caption": "The picturesque seaport town of Cobh is located on the Great Island in Cork Harbour, one of the largest natural harbours in the world. Cobh has a very long and interesting history. Being a major transatlantic port, Cobh was the departure point for many Irish emigrants to North America, and was the final port of call for the RMS Titanic.",
          "alt": "The picturesque seaport town of Cobh is located on the Great Island in Cork Harbour, one of the largest natural harbours in the world. Cobh has a very long and interesting history. Being a major transatlantic port, Cobh was the departure point for many Irish emigrants to North America, and was the final port of call for the RMS Titanic.",
